OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Facross the Peak District should fade
OL,7,Fovernight, with a mix of cloudy and
OL,8,Fclear spells developing for most
OL,9,Fareas. The south-westerly wind eases
OL,10,Fto a gentle breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry start to the day with
OL,13,Fprolonged sunny spells for some.
OL,14,FClouding over by the afternoon, with
OL,15,Fmost places staying dry; isolated
OL,16,Fshowers mostly across the Peak
OL,17,FDistrict.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
