OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,6,Fgrey and windy on Wednesday, becoming
OL,7,Fdrier and more settled towards the end
OL,8,Fof the week, although overnight rain
OL,9,FThursday into Friday may be heavy in
OL,10,Fplaces. Mild nights.
